AMENDEDANALYSIS
Thisbill:
I. Adjusts the personal needs allowance for nursing home residents to reflect social security
increasesonanannualbasisratherthanthecurrent5-yearadjustment.
II. Makes an appropriation to the department of health and human services to fund certain
leave accrual and retention payments for temporary classified staff positions at the Hampstead
hospitalandresidentialtreatmentfacility.
III. Establishes the Hampstead hospital and residential treatment facility capital investment
fund.

